        </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TdCzdXa4ULuiaFVJqZibR0xibnj7aQRNRfckXjia1FRic9ABvSLEvkV5gHAVvHSNW4uCqh7uXIhfu6esg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;zoom: 1;font-size: 14px;\">\n          2011开始，现任经营者安东尼(Antonio Meneses)，决定办理庄园优质微批次的独立竞标，如同\n          <a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%B7%B4%E6%8B%BF%E9%A9%AC%E5%\" style=\"outline: 0px;zoom: 1;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;zoom: 1;text-decoration: underline;\">\n            巴拿马\n           </span>\n</a>\n          的翡翠庄园般，这也是目前咖啡界少数的庄园单一竞标出现。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TdCzdXa4ULuiaFVJqZibR0xibHc9icPYpqFLu5OuEyUO2peeEaFXbEK7rqN5M6M8SLSJVKhHiaq5hyFuw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TdCzdXa4ULuiaFVJqZibR0xib35icbF7wFPticov3lqc9TkaHUq3KVicIn7v3EegAQWM0P5wmUaSdTjbUQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-align: center;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, B